# StockSense — Complete Master Build Plan

---

## Context

StockSense is an intelligent NSE stock market system modeled on Angel One's UI with an additional Intelligence Dashboard. The system chains four reasoning layers — LightGBM ensemble, Kronos foundation model, a commander-grade SLM (Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct), and Claude CLI — each producing explicit, human-readable reasoning that streams live into a multi-terminal dashboard. The system learns every day: EOD and weekend Claude Opus reviews compare predictions to actuals, extract structured learnings, and feed those back into every subsequent run. After two months of daily market runs, the system is intended to be a self-improving NSE intelligence engine.

A partial scaffold exists (backend routers, ML pipeline, intelligence layer) but is not production-ready: no scheduler, empty frontend, missing requirements.txt and docker-compose, incomplete ORM, fragile JSON parsing, and hardcoded config throughout. This plan rebuilds and extends the scaffold into a complete, runnable system.

**User answers locked in:**
- SLM commander training: Claude distillation — Claude CLI generates veteran-grade (situation → judgment) pairs from 26yr NSE data, then QLoRA fine-tune Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct via Unsloth
- First milestone: Multi-terminal dashboard, live-streaming reasoning from all models
- Live data: Phase 2 — yfinance + daily data first, Angel One SmartAPI in second phase

---

## Architecture Overview

```
NSE DATA (2000–2026)
    yfinance daily OHLCV → TimescaleDB → Feature Engine
    Angel One SmartAPI 1min → TimescaleDB (Phase 2)

PIPELINE (every 30min, 9:15–15:30 IST)
    ALL NSE STOCKS → LightGBM (SHAP reasoning) 
                   → Kronos (candle-path forecast)
                   → Combine (agreement/conflict detection)
                   → SLM Commander (NSE-context, portfolio guard, stop/target)
                   → Claude Sonnet CLI (top 40 batch confirm/reject)
                   → DB (signal + full reasoning chain per model)
                   → SSE stream → Frontend

EOD JOB (15:45 IST)
    All today's signals → actual closes → Claude Opus CLI
    → structured learnings → DB → fed back to SLM next day

WEEKEND JOB (Saturday 9:00 AM)
    Week's learnings + accuracy stats → Claude Opus CLI
    → regime assessment, pattern analysis, model calibration notes → DB

FRONTEND
    Angel One dark theme clone (5 existing tabs)
    + Intelligence Dashboard tab (4-terminal live view)
    + Learnings sub-tab (EOD logs, weekly review)
```

