### Phase 7: Backend SSE Refactor
**Goal:** Terminals stream per-model results as they happen, not at the end.

Refactor `backend/main.py::stream_signals()` to emit granular events:

```python
# Current: emits full signal at end
yield f"data: {json.dumps(signal)}\n\n"

# New: emits per-stage events
yield f"data: {json.dumps({'type':'ml_result', 'ticker': t, 'signal': ml['signal'], 'reasoning': ml['reasoning'], 'confidence': ml['confidence']})}\n\n"
# ... after Kronos ...
yield f"data: {json.dumps({'type':'kronos_result', 'ticker': t, ...})}\n\n"
# ... after SLM ...
yield f"data: {json.dumps({'type':'slm_result', 'ticker': t, ...})}\n\n"
```

