### Phase 8: Accuracy Feedback Loop
**Goal:** Model weights adjust based on real accuracy over time.

#### Add `intelligence/accuracy_tracker.py` (new file)
- Runs nightly (after EOD review)
- Computes rolling 7-day accuracy per model (LightGBM, Kronos, combined)
- Updates `model_accuracy` table
- If LightGBM 7-day accuracy > Kronos: shift weights (60/40 instead of 40/60)
- If combined accuracy below 52% for 7 consecutive days: flag for retraining, log alert

#### Update `models/kronos/combine.py`
- Read weights from `model_accuracy` table instead of hardcoding
- Fallback to 40/60 if no data yet

